Buildium
all-in-oneProperty management software that supports tenant screening, online rent collection, maintenance requests, and owner reporting.
Online rent collection with tenant portal access that posts automatically to property ledgers
Buildium stands out for combining tenant-facing payment workflows with property management operations in one system. It supports automated rent collection, online payments, and a full ledger for rent, fees, and balances. Core back-office modules cover maintenance requests, resident communications, and document storage tied to properties. Reporting and workflows help teams track delinquencies and manage units without stitching separate tools.
Pros
- Tenant payment and resident portal workflows reduce manual rent processing time.
- Strong property accounting with detailed ledgers for rent, fees, and balances.
- Maintenance request and communication tools keep requests tied to units.
- Delinquency tracking and reporting supports clear follow-up workflows.
Cons
- Setup and property configuration can take time for multi-building portfolios.
- Some advanced workflows require deeper system knowledge to configure cleanly.
- Reporting customization is less flexible than spreadsheet-first processes.
Best For
Property managers needing tenant payments plus integrated accounting and maintenance workflows
